• Develop and manage a content calendar that aligns with marketing goals and audience interests.     &nbsp;

• Collaborate with internal teams and external partners to create high-quality, engaging content.     &nbsp;

• Plan and manage paid digital advertising campaigns, display ads, and social media ads.     &nbsp;

